  use of different isotopes.

- The backup file should be a tool for debugging only. This means that it only 
  needs to include
  * the state of the random number generator
  * if( ldam ) the histogram files HIS, HIS2, HIS3 depending on dam%ndim
  * if( ldyn ) the surface, the cell boundary positions, and the cell contents
  The first item means to define a new seed for the Knuth random number 
  generator.
  The second item means to remove many of the statistics from the backup file. 
  The last item means to include additional content.

